 runCounterfactual:'Run selected reviewed profiles from the INITIAL household, independently of current exercise commits. Optional retestPlan applies bounded validated preparation commands on a separate initial-state copy before the SAME incident schedule. Compare unknowns and remaining requirements; this is hypothetical, never a user-action commit or household update.',
